{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13101280","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13101280","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1310128001:0":{"text":"샤예바 씨, 괜찮으세요?","source_cn":"莎耶娃女士，你们还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x680A139A6A8BF18D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310128002:0":{"text":"저, 전 괜찮아요. 하지만 로만이... 기절했어요! 제발 그를 구해주세요!","source_cn":"我、我没事，但小罗曼……他昏过去了！求你们帮帮他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CE9F840BD49EC57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310128003:0":{"text":"어디 봐요... 음, 외상은 없네요. 그냥 놀라서 기절한 거예요.","source_cn":"让我看看……嗯，没有外伤，是惊吓导致的晕厥。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF38243E3C5DA164","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310128004:0":{"text":"걱정 마세요. 건강에는 별문제 없을 거예요.","source_cn":"别担心，他的身体没什么大问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9C7C9302BAC6347","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310128005:0":{"text":"일단 팔라모르 씨의 오두막으로 가서 피해 계세요. 저희가 그 몬스터를 쫓아내고 돌아갈게요.","source_cn":"你们先去法拉莫尔先生的小屋躲躲吧。我们先把那些怪物都赶...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD23D874F180DAA23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310128006:0":{"text":"걱정 마세요. 로만은 별일 없을 거예요!","source_cn":"放心吧，小罗曼不会有事的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17345CAC70BA1373","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1310128007:0":{"text":"아... 알겠어요...","source_cn":"好……好的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAB01518C748F658","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莎耶娃":{"text":"샤예바","source":"莎耶娃","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}